{"id":"relacio_n","lemma":"relación","pos":"noun","rank":542,"glosses":["relation","relationship"],"ipa":"/relaˈθjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"relaciones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/19/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-relaci%C3%B3n.wav","formAudio":{"relaciones":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f1/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Precision27-relaciones.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Teníamos una estrecha relación.","en":"We were really tight.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/850165"},{"text":"Las relaciones humanas son complejas.","en":"Human relationships are complex.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/306366"},{"text":"No estoy buscando una relación.","en":"I'm not looking for a relationship.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594845"},{"text":"Hemos roto relaciones con ellos.","en":"We've broken off relations with them."},{"text":"Mantuvieron su relación en secreto.","en":"They kept their relationship a secret.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/586667"}]}